{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01795","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难 · 鲍溶","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉堂向夕如无人，丝竹俨然宫商死。\n细人何言入君耳？尘生金尊酒如水。\n君今不念岁蹉跎，雁天明明凉露多。\n华灯青凝久照夜，彩童窈窕虚垂罗。\n入宫见妬君不察，莫入此地出风波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}